<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Battleplan Extinguished Sins"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="净罪作战"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Elizabeth Hull"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="FROOT JOOCE"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Martin Gonzalez"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Monster Siren Records"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Nocturne &amp; Heretic"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="塞壬唱片-MSR"/><amll:meta key="album" value="危机合约净罪作战 (Original Soundtrack) - Single"/><amll:meta key="album" value="危机合约净罪作战OST"/><amll:meta key="album" value="危機合約淨罪作戰OST"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="TWU712500847"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2672191019"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="002teQmJ0vSz7N"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="559571511"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="4KBNmwU6E4t3DaRvHSTHYB"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1795893587"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:45.900"><div begin="21.480" end="3:45.900"><p begin="21.480" end="25.110" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.480" end="22.110">Ra</span><span begin="22.110" end="22.200">ge</span> <span begin="22.510" end="22.780">from</span> <span begin="22.780" end="22.900">the</span> <span begin="22.980" end="23.240">moun</span><span begin="23.330" end="23.780">tain</span> <span begin="23.780" end="23.960">bli</span><span begin="23.960" end="24.190">s</span><span begin="24.190" end="24.980">ter</span><span begin="24.980" end="25.110">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">山巅迸发的怒火灼烧一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">山巔迸發的怒火灼燒一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">山より噴き出す怒りが焼きただれる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">산에서 뿜어진 분노가 살을 태워</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La rage de la montagne brûle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La furia de la montaña abrasa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Zorn des Berges schlägt glühende Wunden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A fúria da montanha queima e deixa feridas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ярость гор обжигает всё вокруг</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La furia della montagna ustiona</span></p><p begin="25.820" end="28.360" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.820" end="26.050">Like</span> <span begin="26.050" end="26.110">the</span> <span begin="26.110" end="26.260">s</span><span begin="26.260" end="26.910">tone</span> <span begin="26.910" end="27.030">be</span><span begin="27.110" end="27.330">nea</span><span begin="27.330" end="27.490">th</span> <span begin="27.490" end="27.790">my</span> <span begin="27.890" end="28.330">fee</span><span begin="28.330" end="28.360">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同我脚下滚烫的岩石</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如同我腳下滾燙的岩石</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">足元の岩石のように</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 발밑의 돌처럼 뜨겁게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme la pierre sous mes pieds</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como la roca bajo mis pies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie der Stein unter meinen Füßen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como a pedra sob os meus pés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Как раскалённый камень под моими ногами</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come la pietra sotto i miei piedi</span></p><p begin="29.130" end="31.250" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.130" end="29.360">Where</span> <span begin="29.360" end="29.430">the</span> <span begin="29.560" end="29.970">de</span><span begin="29.970" end="30.280">mon</span><span begin="30.280" end="30.360">s</span> <span begin="30.360" end="30.580">fe</span><span begin="30.580" end="30.820">s</span><span begin="30.820" end="31.250">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恶魔在那里滋生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">惡魔在那裡滋生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">悪魔どもが蔓延る場所で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">악마들이 곪아 자라나는 곳에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Là où les démons suppurent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Donde los demonios se pudren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wo die Dämonen schwären</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Onde os demônios apodrecem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Там где гноятся демоны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Là dove i demoni marciscono</span></p><p begin="31.250" end="33.320" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.250" end="31.330">And</span> <span begin="31.420" end="31.780">pray</span> <span begin="31.880" end="32.100">for</span> <span begin="32.100" end="32.500">our</span> <span begin="32.500" end="32.590">de</span><span begin="32.690" end="33.260">fea</span><span begin="33.260" end="33.320">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祈求着我们的败亡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">祈求著我們的敗亡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">奴らは我らの敗北を祈っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 패배를 기도하지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et prient pour notre défaite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y rezan por nuestra derrota</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und für unsere Niederlage beten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E rezam pela nossa derrota</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И молятся о нашем поражении</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E pregano per la nostra disfatta</span></p><p begin="33.720" end="38.040" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.720" end="33.910">I</span> <span begin="34.070" end="34.410">see</span> <span begin="34.410" end="34.570">s</span><span begin="34.570" end="35.560">mo</span><span begin="35.560" end="35.610">ke</span> <span begin="35.770" end="35.990">on</span> <span begin="35.990" end="36.120">the</span> <span begin="36.200" end="36.380">hot</span> <span begin="36.620" end="37.070">wind</span> <span begin="37.170" end="37.450">shim</span><span begin="37.450" end="38.040">mer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看见浓烟在灼热的风中摇曳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我看見濃煙在灼熱的風中搖曳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">熱風の中で揺らめく煙が見える</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">뜨거운 바람 속에서 아른거리는 연기가 보여</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vois la fumée trembler dans le vent brûlant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Veo el humo temblar en el viento ardiente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich sehe Rauch im heißen Wind flimmern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vejo a fumaça tremeluzir no vento ardente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я вижу как дым дрожит в раскалённом ветру</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vedo il fumo tremolare nel vento ardente</span></p><p begin="38.410" end="42.010" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.410" end="38.830">Soul</span><span begin="38.830" end="38.890">s</span> <span begin="38.890" end="39.270">un</span><span begin="39.270" end="39.340">re</span><span begin="39.340" end="39.480">s</span><span begin="39.480" end="39.910">train</span><span begin="39.910" end="39.950">ed,</span> <span begin="39.950" end="40.230">in</span> <span begin="40.330" end="40.540">de</span><span begin="40.540" end="40.760">s</span><span begin="40.760" end="40.980">perate</span> <span begin="41.170" end="41.970">nee</span><span begin="41.970" end="42.010">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失控的灵魂 已无比渴求</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">失控的靈魂 已無比渴求</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">解き放たれた魂は必死に求めている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">속박에서 풀려난 영혼들은 간절히 원하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des âmes déchaînées qui ont désespérément besoin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Almas sin cadenas que necesitan desesperadamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Entfesselte Seelen in verzweifelter Not</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Almas sem freios em necessidade desesperada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Неукрощённым душам отчаянно нужен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anime senza catene disperatamente bisognose</span></p><p begin="42.370" end="44.460" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.370" end="42.580">Of</span> <span begin="42.580" end="42.670">a</span> <span begin="42.770" end="43.220">fi</span><span begin="43.220" end="43.610">nal</span> <span begin="43.610" end="43.860">hell</span><span begin="44.000" end="44.460">fire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那最后一场地狱烈火</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那最後一場地獄烈火</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">最後の業火を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마지막 지옥불을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">D’un ultime feu infernal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un último fuego infernal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nach einem letzten Höllenfeuer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">De um último fogo infernal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Последний адский огонь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Di un ultimo fuoco infernale</span></p><p begin="44.460" end="47.960" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.460" end="44.540">To</span> <span begin="44.670" end="45.090">burn</span> <span begin="45.090" end="45.160">the</span> <span begin="45.290" end="45.600">pa</span><span begin="45.600" end="45.720">st</span> <span begin="45.720" end="45.950">and</span> <span begin="46.070" end="46.360">set</span> <span begin="46.510" end="46.850">them</span> <span begin="46.950" end="47.960">free</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将过往焚尽 还他们以自由</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將過往焚盡 還他們以自由</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">過去を焼き払い 自由になるために</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">과거를 불태워 자신들을 해방시킬 불꽃을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour brûler le passé et les libérer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Que queme el pasado y las libere</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das die Vergangenheit verbrennt und sie befreit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para queimar o passado e libertá-las</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы сжечь прошлое и освободить их</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che bruci il passato e le renda libere</span></p><p begin="48.370" end="51.270" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.370" end="48.600">Through</span> <span begin="48.600" end="48.680">the</span> <span begin="48.810" end="49.230">fear,</span> <span begin="49.230" end="49.440">through</span> <span begin="49.440" end="49.630">the</span> <span begin="49.630" end="50.080">heart</span> <span begin="50.080" end="50.360">that</span><span begin="50.360" end="50.470">&apos;s</span> <span begin="50.470" end="50.690">bro</span><span begin="50.690" end="51.270">ken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过恐惧 穿过那颗破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過恐懼 穿過那顆破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">恐怖を越え 傷つき砕けた心を越え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두려움을 지나 부서진 마음을 지나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers la peur à travers ce cœur brisé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través del miedo a través del corazón quebrado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch die Angst durch das gebrochene Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através do medo através do coração despedaçado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь страх сквозь разбитое сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso la paura attraverso il cuore spezzato</span></p><p begin="51.720" end="54.600" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.720" end="52.180">Our</span> <span begin="52.180" end="52.550">world</span> <span begin="52.970" end="53.360">lie</span><span begin="53.360" end="53.420">s</span> <span begin="53.420" end="53.620">in</span> <span begin="53.620" end="53.850">wait</span> <span begin="53.950" end="54.120">for</span> <span begin="54.200" end="54.600">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的世界正等待着我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們的世界正等待著我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この世界は私を待ち構えている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 세계가 나를 기다리고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Notre monde m’attend dans l’ombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nuestro mundo me aguarda al acecho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unsere Welt liegt da und wartet auf mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nosso mundo está à minha espera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наш мир затаился в ожидании меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il nostro mondo resta in attesa di me</span></p><p begin="54.960" end="57.950" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.960" end="55.160">E</span><span begin="55.160" end="55.230">ve</span><span begin="55.230" end="55.320">ry</span> <span begin="55.410" end="55.870">tear,</span> <span begin="55.870" end="56.020">e</span><span begin="56.020" end="56.070">ve</span><span begin="56.070" end="56.150">ry</span> <span begin="56.150" end="56.290">s</span><span begin="56.290" end="56.720">car</span> <span begin="56.720" end="56.990">le</span><span begin="56.990" end="57.060">f</span><span begin="57.060" end="57.130">t</span> <span begin="57.130" end="57.270">o</span><span begin="57.320" end="57.950">pen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一滴泪 每一道尚未愈合的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每一滴淚 每一道尚未癒合的傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべての涙 すべての開いたままの傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 눈물 아물지 않은 모든 흉터</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque larme chaque cicatrice encore béante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz aún abierta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jede Träne jede offen gebliebene Narbe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz ainda aberta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждая слеза каждый незаживший шрам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni lacrima ogni cicatrice rimasta aperta</span></p><p begin="58.320" end="1:01.110" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.320" end="58.650">Thi</span><span begin="58.650" end="58.800">s</span> <span begin="58.800" end="59.100">i</span><span begin="59.100" end="59.190">s</span> <span begin="59.380" end="59.520">the</span> <span begin="59.520" end="1:00.010">ta</span><span begin="1:00.010" end="1:00.210">ming</span> <span begin="1:00.210" end="1:00.420">of</span> <span begin="1:00.420" end="1:00.480">the</span> <span begin="1:00.620" end="1:00.990">bea</span><span begin="1:00.990" end="1:01.110">st</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是驯服野兽之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是馴服野獸之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今こそ獣を屈服させる時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이것이 짐승을 길들이는 방식이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est ainsi qu’on dompte la bête</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así se doma a la bestia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist die Zähmung der Bestie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É assim que se doma a fera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это укрощение зверя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è domare la bestia</span></p><p begin="1:01.410" end="1:04.370" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.410" end="1:01.870">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:01.870" end="1:02.270">end</span> <span begin="1:02.270" end="1:02.480">thi</span><span begin="1:02.480" end="1:02.680">s</span> <span begin="1:02.680" end="1:03.110">war</span> <span begin="1:03.110" end="1:03.350">you</span> <span begin="1:03.350" end="1:03.520">s</span><span begin="1:03.520" end="1:03.910">tar</span><span begin="1:03.910" end="1:04.370">ted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会终结由你挑起的战争</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會終結由你挑起的戰爭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前が始めたこの戦争を私が終わらせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 시작한 이 전쟁을 내가 끝내겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je mettrai fin à cette guerre que tu as déclenchée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pondré fin a esta guerra que tú empezaste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diesen Krieg beenden den du begonnen hast</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou pôr fim à guerra que você começou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я положу конец войне которую ты начал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Metterò fine alla guerra che hai iniziato</span></p><p begin="1:04.710" end="1:07.780" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.710" end="1:05.010">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:05.010" end="1:05.160">s</span><span begin="1:05.160" end="1:05.400">ti</span><span begin="1:05.400" end="1:05.570">tch</span> <span begin="1:05.570" end="1:05.720">thi</span><span begin="1:05.800" end="1:05.980">s</span> <span begin="1:05.980" end="1:06.330">woun</span><span begin="1:06.330" end="1:06.380">d</span> <span begin="1:06.380" end="1:06.620">wi</span><span begin="1:06.620" end="1:06.730">th</span> <span begin="1:06.730" end="1:07.070">blood</span><span begin="1:07.170" end="1:07.780">shed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会以鲜血将这道伤口缝合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會以鮮血將這道傷口縫合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流血でこの傷を縫い合わせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 상처를 피로 꿰매겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je recoudrai cette blessure avec le sang versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Suturaré esta herida con sangre derramada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diese Wunde mit Blutvergießen vernähen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou suturar esta ferida com sangue derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я зашью эту рану кровопролитием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricucirò questa ferita con altro sangue</span></p><p begin="1:08.220" end="1:16.070" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.220" end="1:08.700">You</span> <span begin="1:08.700" end="1:09.080">are</span> <span begin="1:09.340" end="1:09.580">my</span> <span begin="1:09.580" end="1:09.750">wi</span><span begin="1:09.830" end="1:10.040">cked</span> <span begin="1:10.150" end="1:10.510">vic</span><span begin="1:10.510" end="1:10.770">to</span><span begin="1:10.770" end="1:16.070">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我染罪的胜利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你就是我染罪的勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前こそ私の邪悪なる勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 나의 사악한 승리야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es ma victoire impie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres mi victoria maldita</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist mein unheilvoller Sieg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a minha vitória profana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты моя порочная победа</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei la mia vittoria maledetta</span></p><p begin="1:29.050" end="1:34.760" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.050" end="1:29.180">D</span><span begin="1:29.180" end="1:29.620">raw</span> <span begin="1:29.620" end="1:29.970">me</span> <span begin="1:29.970" end="1:30.230">to</span> <span begin="1:30.230" end="1:30.420">the</span> <span begin="1:30.420" end="1:31.460">light,</span> <span begin="1:32.020" end="1:32.150">let</span> <span begin="1:32.260" end="1:32.340">the</span> <span begin="1:32.430" end="1:32.660">cur</span><span begin="1:32.660" end="1:32.800">se</span> <span begin="1:32.890" end="1:33.290">be</span> <span begin="1:33.290" end="1:33.460">li</span><span begin="1:33.460" end="1:33.570">f</span><span begin="1:33.720" end="1:34.720">te</span><span begin="1:34.720" end="1:34.760">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">引我走向光明 让这诅咒就此解除</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">引我走向光明 讓這詛咒就此解除</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を光へ導け 呪いを解き放て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 빛으로 이끌어 저주를 걷어 내</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Attire-moi vers la lumière que la malédiction soit levée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Atráeme hacia la luz deja que la maldición se disipe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zieh mich ins Licht lass den Fluch von mir weichen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Leve-me até a luz deixe a maldição se desfazer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Веди меня к свету пусть проклятие спадёт</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Guidami verso la luce lascia che la maledizione sia spezzata</span></p><p begin="1:35.390" end="1:38.230" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.390" end="1:35.570">We</span> <span begin="1:35.570" end="1:35.810">can</span> <span begin="1:35.810" end="1:36.360">ri</span><span begin="1:36.360" end="1:36.420">se</span> <span begin="1:36.420" end="1:36.510">a</span><span begin="1:36.640" end="1:36.910">bo</span><span begin="1:36.910" end="1:37.020">ve</span> <span begin="1:37.020" end="1:37.260">the</span> <span begin="1:37.260" end="1:38.230">roar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能够凌驾于这咆哮之上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們能夠凌駕於這咆哮之上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この咆哮さえ乗り越えてゆける</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 그 포효마저 뛰어넘을 수 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous pouvons nous élever au-dessus du fracas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Podemos alzarnos por encima del rugido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir können uns über das Tosen erheben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Podemos nos erguer acima do rugido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы поднимемся над этим рёвом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Possiamo elevarci sopra il fragore</span></p><p begin="1:38.900" end="1:40.520" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.900" end="1:38.990">With</span> <span begin="1:39.110" end="1:39.180">the</span> <span begin="1:39.320" end="1:39.520">bi</span><span begin="1:39.520" end="1:39.580">te</span> <span begin="1:39.580" end="1:39.740">of</span> <span begin="1:39.740" end="1:39.900">e</span><span begin="1:39.900" end="1:39.940">ve</span><span begin="1:39.940" end="1:40.020">ry</span> <span begin="1:40.140" end="1:40.350">de</span><span begin="1:40.350" end="1:40.520">vil</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凭借每一个恶魔留下的獠牙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">憑藉每一個惡魔留下的獠牙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これまで屠ってきた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 쓰러뜨려 온 모든 악마의</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec la morsure de tous les démons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con la mordida de cada demonio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit dem Biss jedes Teufels</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Com a mordida de cada demônio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">С каждым укусом каждого дьявола</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Con il morso di ogni diavolo</span></p><p begin="1:40.560" end="1:43.090" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.560" end="1:40.850">We</span><span begin="1:40.850" end="1:40.920">&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:40.920" end="1:41.480">felled</span> <span begin="1:41.590" end="1:42.140">be</span><span begin="1:42.140" end="1:43.090">fore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些曾被我们斩倒的恶魔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那些曾被我們斬倒的惡魔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべての悪魔の牙をもって</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">날카로운 이빨을 품고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que nous avons déjà abattus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Que ya hemos abatido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den wir zuvor zu Fall gebracht haben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que já abatemos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Которого мы уже повергли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che abbiamo già abbattuto</span></p><p begin="1:43.140" end="1:44.940" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.140" end="1:43.630">Drown</span> <span begin="1:43.630" end="1:43.980">them</span> <span begin="1:44.060" end="1:44.890">ou</span><span begin="1:44.890" end="1:44.940">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将他们的声音彻底淹没</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將他們的聲音徹底淹沒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">奴らの声を掻き消せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 묻어 버려</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Fais-les taire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Siléncialos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Übertönt sie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Abafe todos eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Заглуши их</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Soffoca le loro voci</span></p><p begin="1:45.480" end="1:47.480" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.480" end="1:45.610">Let</span> <span begin="1:45.720" end="1:45.780">the</span> <span begin="1:45.890" end="1:46.170">fog</span> <span begin="1:46.170" end="1:46.290">gi</span><span begin="1:46.290" end="1:46.380">ve</span> <span begin="1:46.380" end="1:46.560">way</span> <span begin="1:46.560" end="1:46.670">to</span> <span begin="1:46.670" end="1:47.000">cla</span><span begin="1:47.000" end="1:47.170">ri</span><span begin="1:47.170" end="1:47.480">ty</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让迷雾散尽 一切重归清明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓迷霧散盡 一切重歸清明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">霧を晴らし 明晰なる視界を取り戻せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">안개가 걷히고 선명함이 드러나게 해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que le brouillard cède enfin à la clarté</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Deja que la niebla ceda ante la claridad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass den Nebel der Klarheit weichen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que a névoa dê lugar à clareza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пусть туман рассеется уступая ясности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lascia che la nebbia ceda alla chiarezza</span></p><p begin="1:47.970" end="1:51.110" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.970" end="1:48.200">There</span> <span begin="1:48.200" end="1:48.280">i</span><span begin="1:48.280" end="1:48.380">s</span> <span begin="1:48.380" end="1:48.630">po</span><span begin="1:48.630" end="1:48.840">wer</span> <span begin="1:48.840" end="1:49.020">in</span> <span begin="1:49.020" end="1:49.090">the</span> <span begin="1:49.090" end="1:49.230">s</span><span begin="1:49.230" end="1:49.490">train</span> <span begin="1:49.490" end="1:49.660">of</span> <span begin="1:49.660" end="1:49.820">e</span><span begin="1:49.820" end="1:49.880">ve</span><span begin="1:49.880" end="1:50.010">ry</span> <span begin="1:50.010" end="1:50.380">dro</span><span begin="1:50.380" end="1:50.420">p</span> <span begin="1:50.420" end="1:50.590">I</span> <span begin="1:50.690" end="1:51.070">blee</span><span begin="1:51.070" end="1:51.110">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我流下的每一滴血 都凝聚着力量</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我流下的每一滴血 都凝聚著力量</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流す血の一滴一滴 その苦痛の中に力が宿る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 흘리는 피 한 방울 한 방울의 고통 속엔 힘이 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque goutte de sang que je verse porte en elle une force</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hay poder en cada gota de sangre que derramo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In jedem Tropfen den ich blute liegt Kraft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Há poder no esforço de cada gota que sangro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В каждой капле моей крови есть сила страдания</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">C&apos;è potere nello sforzo di ogni goccia che verso</span></p><p begin="1:51.310" end="1:56.270" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.310" end="1:51.740">I</span> <span begin="1:51.740" end="1:52.070">a</span><span begin="1:52.070" end="1:52.130">m</span> <span begin="1:52.320" end="1:52.390">the</span> <span begin="1:52.520" end="1:52.790">ve</span><span begin="1:52.790" end="1:53.150">no</span><span begin="1:53.150" end="1:53.200">m</span> <span begin="1:53.200" end="1:53.560">and</span> <span begin="1:53.560" end="1:53.720">the</span> <span begin="1:53.720" end="1:56.270">cure</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是剧毒 亦是解药</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我是劇毒 亦是解藥</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私は毒であり その解毒でもある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 독이자 해독제</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis le venin et le remède</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Soy el veneno y la cura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich bin das Gift und das Heilmittel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu sou o veneno e a cura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я яд и я же лекарство</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sono il veleno e la cura</span></p><p begin="1:56.600" end="1:57.880" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.600" end="1:56.960">Ta</span><span begin="1:56.960" end="1:57.080">ke</span> <span begin="1:57.080" end="1:57.880">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">帶我走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を連れていけ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 데려가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Emporte-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Llévame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nimm mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Leve-me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забери меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Prendimi</span></p><p begin="1:57.880" end="2:00.790" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.880" end="1:58.120">Through</span> <span begin="1:58.120" end="1:58.200">the</span> <span begin="1:58.300" end="1:58.740">fear,</span> <span begin="1:58.740" end="1:58.950">through</span> <span begin="1:58.950" end="1:59.160">the</span> <span begin="1:59.160" end="1:59.590">heart</span> <span begin="1:59.590" end="1:59.880">that</span><span begin="1:59.880" end="1:59.990">&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:59.990" end="2:00.210">bro</span><span begin="2:00.210" end="2:00.790">ken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过恐惧 穿过那颗破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過恐懼 穿過那顆破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">恐怖を越え 傷つき砕けた心を越え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두려움을 지나 부서진 마음을 지나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers la peur à travers ce cœur brisé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través del miedo a través del corazón quebrado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch die Angst durch das gebrochene Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através do medo através do coração despedaçado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь страх сквозь разбитое сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso la paura attraverso il cuore spezzato</span></p><p begin="2:01.230" end="2:04.140" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.230" end="2:01.680">Our</span> <span begin="2:01.680" end="2:02.060">world</span> <span begin="2:02.470" end="2:02.860">lie</span><span begin="2:02.860" end="2:02.940">s</span> <span begin="2:02.940" end="2:03.070">in</span> <span begin="2:03.150" end="2:03.380">wait</span> <span begin="2:03.460" end="2:03.630">for</span> <span begin="2:03.720" end="2:04.140">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的世界正等待着我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們的世界正等待著我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この世界は私を待ち構えている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 세계가 나를 기다리고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Notre monde m’attend dans l’ombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nuestro mundo me aguarda al acecho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unsere Welt liegt da und wartet auf mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nosso mundo está à minha espera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наш мир затаился в ожидании меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il nostro mondo resta in attesa di me</span></p><p begin="2:04.480" end="2:07.470" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.480" end="2:04.680">E</span><span begin="2:04.680" end="2:04.740">ve</span><span begin="2:04.740" end="2:04.840">ry</span> <span begin="2:04.920" end="2:05.390">tear,</span> <span begin="2:05.390" end="2:05.550">e</span><span begin="2:05.550" end="2:05.600">ve</span><span begin="2:05.600" end="2:05.660">ry</span> <span begin="2:05.660" end="2:05.810">s</span><span begin="2:05.810" end="2:06.250">car</span> <span begin="2:06.250" end="2:06.510">le</span><span begin="2:06.510" end="2:06.580">f</span><span begin="2:06.580" end="2:06.630">t</span> <span begin="2:06.630" end="2:06.780">o</span><span begin="2:06.850" end="2:07.470">pen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一滴泪 每一道尚未愈合的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每一滴淚 每一道尚未癒合的傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべての涙 すべての開いたままの傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 눈물 아물지 않은 모든 흉터</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque larme chaque cicatrice encore béante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz aún abierta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jede Träne jede offen gebliebene Narbe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz ainda aberta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждая слеза каждый незаживший шрам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni lacrima ogni cicatrice rimasta aperta</span></p><p begin="2:07.830" end="2:10.630" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.830" end="2:08.160">Thi</span><span begin="2:08.160" end="2:08.300">s</span> <span begin="2:08.300" end="2:08.630">i</span><span begin="2:08.630" end="2:08.710">s</span> <span begin="2:08.890" end="2:08.950">the</span> <span begin="2:09.050" end="2:09.520">ta</span><span begin="2:09.520" end="2:09.730">ming</span> <span begin="2:09.730" end="2:09.940">of</span> <span begin="2:09.940" end="2:10.020">the</span> <span begin="2:10.140" end="2:10.510">bea</span><span begin="2:10.510" end="2:10.630">st</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是驯服野兽之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是馴服野獸之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今こそ獣を屈服させる時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이것이 짐승을 길들이는 방식이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est ainsi qu’on dompte la bête</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así se doma a la bestia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist die Zähmung der Bestie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É assim que se doma a fera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это укрощение зверя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è domare la bestia</span></p><p begin="2:10.930" end="2:13.930" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.930" end="2:11.390">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="2:11.390" end="2:11.810">end</span> <span begin="2:11.810" end="2:11.980">thi</span><span begin="2:11.980" end="2:12.200">s</span> <span begin="2:12.200" end="2:12.660">war</span> <span begin="2:12.660" end="2:12.870">you</span> <span begin="2:12.870" end="2:13.040">s</span><span begin="2:13.040" end="2:13.440">tar</span><span begin="2:13.440" end="2:13.890">te</span><span begin="2:13.890" end="2:13.930">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会终结由你挑起的战争</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會終結由你挑起的戰爭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前が始めたこの戦争を私が終わらせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 시작한 이 전쟁을 내가 끝내겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je mettrai fin à cette guerre que tu as déclenchée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pondré fin a esta guerra que tú empezaste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diesen Krieg beenden den du begonnen hast</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou pôr fim à guerra que você começou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я положу конец войне которую ты начал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Metterò fine alla guerra che hai iniziato</span></p><p begin="2:14.240" end="2:17.280" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.240" end="2:14.510">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="2:14.510" end="2:14.690">s</span><span begin="2:14.690" end="2:14.940">ti</span><span begin="2:14.940" end="2:15.100">tch</span> <span begin="2:15.100" end="2:15.270">thi</span><span begin="2:15.270" end="2:15.500">s</span> <span begin="2:15.500" end="2:15.870">woun</span><span begin="2:15.870" end="2:15.940">d</span> <span begin="2:15.940" end="2:16.180">wi</span><span begin="2:16.180" end="2:16.260">th</span> <span begin="2:16.260" end="2:16.600">blood</span><span begin="2:16.690" end="2:17.280">shed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会以鲜血将这道伤口缝合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會以鮮血將這道傷口縫合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流血でこの傷を縫い合わせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 상처를 피로 꿰매겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je recoudrai cette blessure avec le sang versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Suturaré esta herida con sangre derramada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diese Wunde mit Blutvergießen vernähen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou suturar esta ferida com sangue derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я зашью эту рану кровопролитием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricucirò questa ferita con altro sangue</span></p><p begin="2:17.750" end="2:24.090" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.750" end="2:18.220">You</span> <span begin="2:18.220" end="2:18.600">are</span> <span begin="2:18.820" end="2:19.100">my</span> <span begin="2:19.100" end="2:19.250">wi</span><span begin="2:19.340" end="2:19.540">cked</span> <span begin="2:19.650" end="2:19.870">vic</span><span begin="2:20.020" end="2:20.270">to</span><span begin="2:20.270" end="2:21.470">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我染罪的胜利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你就是我染罪的勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前こそ私の邪悪なる勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 나의 사악한 승리야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es ma victoire impie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres mi victoria maldita</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist mein unheilvoller Sieg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a minha vitória profana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты моя порочная победа</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei la mia vittoria maledetta</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2: