" end="2:58.980">nished</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尚未偿还的罪孽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">尚未償還的罪孽</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">裁かれぬ罪は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">벌받지 않은 죄들은</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des péchés restés impunis</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pecados sin castigo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sünden ungesühnt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Pecados impunes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Безнаказанные грехи</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Peccati rimasti impuniti</span></p><p begin="3:00.020" end="3:02.290" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.020" end="3:00.230">Made</span> <span begin="3:00.360" end="3:00.820">pure</span> <span begin="3:00.820" end="3:01.050">be</span><span begin="3:01.050" end="3:01.380">nea</span><span begin="3:01.380" end="3:01.440">th</span> <span begin="3:01.440" end="3:01.560">the</span> <span begin="3:01.660" end="3:02.200">kni</span><span begin="3:02.200" end="3:02.290">fe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在刀锋之下洗净</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在刀鋒之下洗淨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">刃の下で清められる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">칼날 아래 정화되어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Purifiés sous la lame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Purificados bajo el filo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unter der Klinge rein gemacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Purificados sob a lâmina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Очищены под лезвием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Purificati sotto la lama</span></p><p begin="3:03.720" end="3:05.930" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.720" end="3:04.280">Clean</span><span beg