.980" end="3:11.400">our</span> <span begin="3:11.490" end="3:11.760">fu</span><span begin="3:11.870" end="3:12.330">ture</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将自己的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們將自己的未來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちは未来を封じ込める</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 미래를 봉인하리라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous scellons notre avenir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sellamos nuestro futuro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir besiegeln unsere Zukunft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Selamos o nosso futuro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы запечатаем наше будущее</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sigilliamo il nostro futuro</span></p><p begin="3:12.850" end="3:16.030" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.850" end="3:13.020">In</span> <span begin="3:13.020" end="3:13.070">a</span> <span begin="3:13.170" end="3:13.940">bla</span><span begin="3:13.940" end="3:14.080">ze</span> <span begin="3:14.680" end="3:14.810">o</span><span begin="3:14.810" end="3:14.910">f</span> <span begin="3:14.910" end="3:16.030">white</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">封存在炽白烈焰之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">封存在熾白烈焰之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">白き灼光の中に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">백열의 불길 속에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans un brasier d’un blanc aveuglant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En una llamarada blanca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In weißer Glut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Num clarão branco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В ослепительно-белом пламени</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In un incendio di bianco accecante</span></p><p begin="3:17.350" end="3:26.270" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.350" end="3:17.570">Through</span> <span begin="3:17.570" end="3:17.650">the</span> <span begin="3:17.790" end="3:18.180">fear,</span> <span begin="3:18.180" end="3:18.410">through</span> <span begin="3:18.410" end="3:18.510">the</span> <span begin="3:18.620" end="3:18.960">heart</span> <span begin="3:19.050" end="3:19.350">that</span><span begin="3:19.350" end="3:19.460">&apos;s</span> <span begin="3:19.460" end="3:19.870">bro</span><span begin="3:19.870" end="3:23.150">ken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过恐惧 穿过那颗破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過恐懼 穿過那顆破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">恐怖を越え 傷つき砕けた心を越え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두려움을 지나 부서진 마음을 지나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers la peur à travers ce cœur brisé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través del miedo a través del corazón quebrado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch die Angst durch das gebrochene Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através do medo através do coração despedaçado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь страх сквозь разбитое сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso la paura attraverso il cuore spezzato</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:21.930" end="3:26.270"><span begin="3:21.930" end="3:22.260">(Lie</span><span begin="3:22.260" end="3:22.360">s</span> <span begin="3:22.360" end="3:22.580">in</span> <span begin="3:22.580" end="3:22.910">way</span> <span begin="3:22.910" end="3:23.180">for</span> <span begin="3:23.180" end="3:26.270">me)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正等待着我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">正等待著我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を待ち構えている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 기다리고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">M’attend dans l’ombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me aguarda al acecho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Liegt da und wartet auf mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Está à minha espera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ждёт меня на пути</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resta sul mio cammino</span></span></p><p begin="3:23.950" end="3:26.920" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:23.950" end="3:24.150">E</span><span begin="3:24.150" end="3:24.190">ve</span><span begin="3:24.190" end="3:24.290">ry</span> <span begin="3:24.370" end="3:24.840">tear,</span> <span begin="3:24.840" end="3:24.990">e</span><span begin="3:24.990" end="3:25.030">ve</span><span begin="3:25.030" end="3:25.120">ry</span> <span begin="3:25.120" end="3:25.260">s</span><span begin="3:25.260" end="3:25.680">car</span> <span begin="3:25.680" end="3:25.960">le</span><span begin="3:25.960" end="3:26.030">f</span><span begin="3:26.030" end="3:26.090">t</span> <span begin="3:26.090" end="3:26.230">o</span><span begin="3:26.310" end="3:26.920">pen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一滴泪 每一道尚未愈合的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每一滴淚 每一道尚未癒合的傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべての涙 すべての開いたままの傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 눈물 아물지 않은 모든 흉터</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque larme chaque cicatrice encore béante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz aún abierta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jede Träne jede offen gebliebene Narbe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz ainda aberta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждая слеза каждый незаживший шрам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni lacrima ogni cicatrice rimasta aperta</span></p><p begin="3:27.290" end="3:30.060" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:27.290" end="3:27.620">Thi</span><span begin="3:27.620" end="3:27.750">s</span> <span begin="3:27.750" end="3:28.070">i</span><span begin="3:28.070" end="3:28.150">s</span> <span begin="3:28.350" end="3:28.480">the</span> <span begin="3:28.480" end="3:28.980">ta</span><span begin="3:28.980" end="3:29.180">ming</span> <span begin="3:29.180" end="3:29.380">of</span> <span begin="3:29.380" end="3:29.460">the</span> <span begin="3:29.590" end="3:29.960">bea</span><span begin="3:29.960" end="3:30.060">st</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是驯服野兽之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是馴服野獸之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今こそ獣を屈服させる時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이것이 짐승을 길들이는 방식이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est ainsi qu’on dompte la bête</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así se doma a la bestia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist die Zähmung der Bestie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É assim que se doma a fera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это укрощение зверя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è domare la bestia</span></p><p begin="3:30.400" end="3:34.690" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:30.400" end="3:30.820">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="3:30.820" end="3:31.260">end</span> <span begin="3:31.260" end="3:31.430">thi</span><span begin="3:31.430" end="3:31.640">s</span> <span begin="3:31.640" end="3:32.090">war</span> <span begin="3:32.090" end="3:32.290">you</span> <span begin="3:32.290" end="3:32.490">s</span><span begin="3:32.490" end="3:32.890">tar</span><span begin="3:32.890" end="3:33.320">ted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会终结由你挑起的战争</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會終結由你挑起的戰爭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前が始めたこの戦争を私が終わらせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 시작한 이 전쟁을 내가 끝내겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je mettrai fin à cette guerre que tu as déclenchée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pondré fin a esta guerra que tú empezaste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diesen Krieg beenden den du begonnen hast</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou pôr fim à guerra que você começou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я положу конец войне которую ты начал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Metterò fine alla guerra che hai iniziato</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:32.930" end="3:34.690"><span begin="3:32.930" end="3:33.150">(You</span> <span begin="3:33.150" end="3:33.360">s</span><span begin="3:33.360" end="3:33.720">tar</span><span begin="3:33.720" end="3:34.690">ted)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由你挑起的战争</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">由你挑起的戰爭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前が始めた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 시작한</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que tu as déclenchée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Que tú empezaste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den du begonnen hast</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que você começou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Которую ты начал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che hai iniziato</span></span></p><p begin="3:33.700" end="3:38.310" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.700" end="3:33.960">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="3:33.960" end="3:34.130">s</span><span begin="3:34.130" end="3:34.400">ti</span><span begin="3:34.400" end="3:34.560">tch</span> <span begin="3:34.560" end="3:34.730">thi</span><span begin="3:34.730" end="3:34.940">s</span> <span begin="3:34.940" end="3:35.330">woun</span><span begin="3:35.330" end="3:35.380">d</span> <span begin="3:35.380" end="3:35.610">wi</span><span begin="3:35.610" end="3:35.710">th</span> <span begin="3:35.710" end="3:36.040">blood</span><span begin="3:36.150" end="3:36.750">shed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会以鲜血将这道伤口缝合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會以鮮血將這道傷口縫合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流血でこの傷を縫い合わせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 상처를 피로 꿰매겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je recoudrai cette blessure avec le sang versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Suturaré esta herida con sangre derramada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diese Wunde mit Blutvergießen vernähen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou suturar esta ferida com sangue derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я зашью эту рану кровопролитием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricucirò questa ferita con altro sangue</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:36.240" end="3:38.310"><span begin="3:36.240" end="3:36.460">(Wi</span><span begin="3:36.460" end="3:36.560">th</span> <span begin="3:36.560" end="3:36.860">blood</span><span begin="3:36.960" end="3:38.310">shed)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以鲜血缝合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">以鮮血縫合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流血によって</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">피로써</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec le sang versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con sangre derramada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit Blutvergießen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Com sangue derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кровопролитием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Con altro sangue</span></span></p><p begin="3:37.210" end="3:45.900" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:37.210" end="3:37.690">You</span> <span begin="3:37.690" end="3:38.000">are</span> <span begin="3:38.290" end="3:38.550">my</span> <span begin="3:38.550" end="3:38.700">wi</span><span begin="3:38.800" end="3:38.990">cked</span> <span begin="3:39.100" end="3:39.320">vic</span><span begin="3:39.450" end="3:39.730">to</span><span begin="3:39.730" end="3:45.900">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我染罪的胜利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你就是我染罪的勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前こそ私の邪悪なる勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 나의 사악한 승리야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es ma victoire impie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres mi victoria maldita</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist mein unheilvoller Sieg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a minha vitória profana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты моя порочная победа</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei la mia vittoria maledetta</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:38.550" end="3:40.550"><span begin="3:38.550" end="3:38.700">(Wi</span><span begin="3:38.800" end="3:38.990">cked</span> <span begin="3:39.100" end="3:39.320">vic</span><span begin="3:39.450" end="3:39.730">to</span><span begin="3:39.730" end="3:40.550">ry)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">染罪的胜利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">染罪的勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">邪悪なる勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사악한 승리</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Victoire impie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Victoria maldita</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unheilvoller Sieg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vitória profana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Порочная победа</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vittoria maledetta</span></span></p></div></body></tt>